        "content": [
          {
            "acf_fc_layout": "title",
            "kicker": "",
            "kicker_tag": "div",
            "title": "Digital initiatives break down when strategy and execution live in different places.",
            "heading_level": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "add_description": false,
            "description": ""
          }
        ],
        "text_editor": "<p class=\"lead\">Organizations often face one of two failures: strategies that never ship, or execution without strategic clarity. The result is digital investment that fails to translate into measurable performance.</p>\n<p class=\"lead\">O3 brings the thinking and the building together, so priorities become shipped work that performs.</p>\n"
      },
